  "problem": "get_access_plan and get_retrieval_recipe returned generic unknown errors for every request. Public CMS, keyed Census and restricted HCUP could not produce different next steps. Recipes could embed secrets or execute on inspect. Missing cost/quota could be guessed. route_not_documented told clients to retry blindly. Enrichment could be imported into worker/index.mjs. Sealed identity/access-workflows could be edited.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Public CMS, keyed Census and restricted HCUP fixtures produce different legitimate next steps. A returned recipe contains no secret or source payload and does not execute merely because a client inspected it. Credentials are named only. Missing cost/quota stays unknown. Nonretryable route_not_documented points to get_asset or publisher documentation instead of a blind retry. worker/index.mjs does not import enrichment. packages/identity/access-workflows remains unused because identity is WP7-sealed. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
